Project Development Phase
# ComicCraft — Project Development Phase

 The **Development Phase** converts the approved ComicCraft design into a working MVP. The goal is to build a functional AI comic-creation platform where users can enter an idea, use Gemini to generate a structured comic story, edit it, and preview the result.

 ## 1\. Development Goal

 ### MVP outcome

 A user should be able to:

```
Create Project
     ↓
Enter Story Idea
     ↓
Select Genre + Style
     ↓
Generate with Gemini
     ↓
Receive Characters + Story + Pages + Panels
     ↓
Edit Comic
     ↓
Regenerate Content
     ↓
Preview Comic
     ↓
Save Project
```

