 # 7\. Gemini Integration

 Create:

```
src/lib/gemini.ts
```

 The Gemini service should provide a central interface for AI operations.

 Conceptually:

```
generateStory()
generateCharacters()
generateOutline()
generatePanels()
rewriteDialogue()
regeneratePanel()
