 # 16\. Regenerate Panel

 When the user selects:

 **Regenerate Panel**

 send:

```
Story Bible
+
Current Page
+
Current Panel
+
User instruction
```

 to Gemini.

 For example:

 > “Make this scene more suspenseful.”

 The returned panel replaces the existing panel only after user confirmation.

 This prevents accidental loss of work.

