 # 18\. Character Consistency

 Implement the Story Bible during development rather than treating it as a later feature.

 Example:

```
{
  "characters": [
    {
      "name": "Arjun",
      "appearance": "Black hair, blue jacket",
      "personality": "Curious and sarcastic",
      "role": "Main protagonist"
    }
  ],
  "world": "Modern school in Chennai",
  "tone": "Funny sci-fi adventure"
}
```

 Whenever Gemini generates new content, relevant Story Bible information is included.

